@worldcubeassociation.org"},{"name":"Kalani Oliveira","email":"koliveira@worldcubeassociation.org"},{"name":"Lucas Dantas de Sousa","email":"lsousa@worldcubeassociation.org"},{"name":"Matías Ponte","email":"mponte@worldcubeassociation.org"},{"name":"Michel Andre Gonzaga Quijano","email":"mquijano@worldcubeassociation.org"},{"name":"Paula Castro","email":"pascastro3@gmail.com"},{"name":"Paulo Henrique Matos de Moraes","email":"pmoraes@worldcubeassociation.org"}],"organisers":[{"name":"Agrupación Speedcubing Argentina","email":"speedcube.arg@gmail.com"},{"name":"Asociación Mexicana de Speedcubing","email":"contacto@amscubing.org"},{"name":"Associação Brasileira de Cubo Mágico (ABRACM)","email":"contato@abracm.org.br"},{"name":"Club de SpeedCubing Paraguay","email":"speedcubingpy@gmail.com"},{"name":"PUCP Cubing Community","email":"pucpcubingc@pucp.edu.pe"},{"name":"Speedcubing Colombia","email":"eduardoroserovillena@gmail.com"}],"venue":{"name":"Multiple Cities","address":"Multiple Locations","details":"See the locations tab for more information about venue locations","coordinates":{"latitude":-4.442038,"longitude":-61.326853}},"information":"*English:* This competition will hold **only 3x3x3 Fewest Moves event**, and it will be held in multiple locations, across Latin America. Please pay attention to the **date and time zone** of your [location](https://www.worldcubeassociation.org/competitions/FMCLatinAmerica2025#62723-locations-lugares)! Locations may be added until the 9th of august 23:59UTC so if there isn't a location near you yet contact your local [Delegate](https://www.worldcubeassociation.org/delegates) in Latin America. --- *Español:* Esta competencia tendrá **solo el evento 3x3x3 Menos Movimientos**, y se llevará a cabo en múltiples ubicaciones en América Latina. ¡Preste atención a la **fecha y zona horaria** de su [ubicación](https://www.worldcubeassociation.org/competitions/FMCLatinAmerica2025#62723-locations-lugares)! Se pueden agregar ubicaciones hasta